### SkillXchange API Testing via VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 2. Login as Student (Alex Morgan)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Access Token from Response
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Get User Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Fetch All Skills Catalog
GET http://localhost:5000/api/skills

### 5. Get AI/Algorithm Skill Matches
GET http://localhost:5000/api/matches/recommended
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. AI Skill Gap Analysis
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/analyze-skill-gap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetRoleTitle": "Full Stack Developer"
}

### 7. AI Career Chat Assistant
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What skills should I learn to become a backend developer?"
}

### 8. Get Placement Readiness Score
GET http://localhost:5000/api/placement/readiness
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
